(78147,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. Our knowledge expands through your efforts.$B$BIf you discover more magical works that might benefit the library, please bring them to me.',0),
(78148,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. Our knowledge expands through your efforts.$B$BIf you discover more magical works that might benefit the library, please bring them to me.',0),
(78149,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. Our knowledge expands through your efforts.$B$BIf you discover more magical works that might benefit the library, please bring them to me.',0),
(78150,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks to your donations, the library is thriving.$B$BPlease, take this.',0),
(79008,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'As you stumble upon the remnants of yet another charred corpse, your gaze falls upon a message secured to a wooden plank.',0),
(79091,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. You say this is from the Ironforge library? ...I\'m sure they won\'t miss it.$B$BIf you discover more magical works that might benefit the library, please bring them to me.',0),
(79092,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. Our knowledge expands through your efforts.$B$BIf you discover more magical works that might benefit the library, please bring them to me.',0),
(79093,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. Our knowledge expands through your efforts.$B$BIf you discover more magical works that might benefit the library, please bring them to me.',0),
(79094,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. Our knowledge expands through your efforts.$B$BIf you discover more magical works that might benefit the library, please bring them to me.',0),
(79095,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. Our knowledge expands through your efforts.$B$BIf you discover more magical works that might benefit the library, please bring them to me.',0),
(79192,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Backcountry adventurers and mercenaries alike undoubtedly make camp here. The corner of a note flapping in the breeze catches your eye and you reach for it.',0),
(79360,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<You hand the note to Bath\'rah who reads it over and gives a half hearted chuckle.>$B$BAh so it be true mon... I too have sensed much unrest in the elemental plane and dis must be one of the causes.$B$BTo flood all da Thousand Needles would take a great storm and many lives be lost.$B$BI t\'ink I got just da t\'ing for ya, but it won\'t come easy.',0),
(79362,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let\'s get ready to rumble, ya?',0),
(79363,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Shake dat sludge off, we almost done.',0),
(79364,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Knew I could count on you.',0),
(79535,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. Our knowledge expands through your efforts.$B$BIf you discover more magical works that might benefit the library, please bring them to me.',0),
