(84397,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. Our knowledge expands through your efforts.$B$BIf you discover more magical works that might benefit the library, please bring them to me.',0),
(84398,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. Our knowledge expands through your efforts.$B$BIf you discover more magical works that might benefit the library, please bring them to me.',0),
(84399,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. Our knowledge expands through your efforts.$B$BIf you discover more magical works that might benefit the library, please bring them to me.',0),
(84400,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. Our knowledge expands through your efforts.$B$BIf you discover more magical works that might benefit the library, please bring them to me.',0),
(84401,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. Our knowledge expands through your efforts.$B$BIf you discover more magical works that might benefit the library, please bring them to me.',0),
(84402,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. Our knowledge expands through your efforts.$B$BIf you discover more magical works that might benefit the library, please bring them to me.',0),
(86613,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Our tools!$B$BWhen the troggs overran the camp, we had to leave most of our tools behind. This\'ll be a big help once we get this invasion under control and can start working again!',0),
(86614,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My hair clip! I thought this was lost for good!$B$BThis\'ll shine right up with just a little work. Thank you for bringing it to me! I\'ll make it worth your while.',0),
(86667,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This jar is for me?$B$BSnow! Grenhild did it! She sent the snow that I asked for!$B$BA pity, though, I was hoping she would come and visit herself.$B$BUh, anyway, you probably deserve a little something for your effort. Here you go.',0),
(86758,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hah! You did it! I never thought that ol\' croc would get its comeuppance, but that does the trick!$B$BOh ah... y\'know, I had to get me another knife, but maybe that one will bring you some good luck. Why don\'t you hang onto it?',0),
(87288,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, these are wonderful. It is a shame to resort to violence with such majestic animals, but it is important to keep the roads safe, and these pelts will make beautiful blankets and shawls.$B$BHere, let me give you something to remember them. It is both soft and sturdy.',0),
(87318,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Corma sent you? That\'s great news!$B$BWhen the Dark Irons ambushed us, we were separated, and I hit my head and couldn\'t tell which direction I was going. I wound up here and I\'ve been living out of the supplies in my bag for the last few days. Now that you\'ve made it past the Dark Irons, though, it may be possible for me to make my escape.$B$BI just have to gather my things and take a moment to catch my senses, and I\'ll figure out a way to escape!$B$BShe never gave up on me. What a lovely heart.',0),
(87760,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This has been a long journey, $n, but it was worth it.$B$BAt long last, you have wrested away the rod that the naga use to compel the sea creatures into their service. I will make sure it is destroyed, and the threshers and sea turtles can finally live in peace.$B$BThank you again. Your persistence has finally been rewarded, and I, personally, am grateful to you.',0),
(88758,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'She\'s alive? She\'s alive!$B$BLet me see this note... \"Dear Corma...\" mhmm... oh, blessed day! Thank the Light!$B$BI can never thank you enough for reuniting us. I can\'t wait until she makes it back here!$B$BYou\'ve done a wonderful service for us both.',0),
(91724,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It seems like everything is working properly. Thank you, $n.',0),
(91732,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, very nice. Do you see that shine? Truly, they don\'t make them like they used to.',0),
(91736,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The machine dispenses a clear liquid into a bottle...',0),
(91738,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Do my eyes deceive me? I haven\'t seen a drop of Thunder Applejack in months!$BThis should put a smile on the troops\' faces. You have my thanks, $C!',0),
(91740,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'We lost two members of the watch last week to the murlocs, $C. Hopefully with their leader slain, we can start pushing them out of Elwynn.',0),
(91746,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So, you took down Elmpaw? Very impressive, $n!$B$BLet me give you something in return for your trophy - I know a few collectors who will pay quite well to have this on their mantle once I\'ve prepared it.',0),
(91751,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work collecting these pelts, $C. You have a real talent for hunting.',0),
(91860,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The corpse before you was certainly Tauren and you can tell that it was gnawed on heavily before it was tossed onto the pyre. You see no signs of the elf woman that was described to you though. Perhaps she is still alive somewhere deeper in the fortress nearby?$B$BThis will be dangerous, but there\'s only one way to find out for sure.>',0),
(91861,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You are one of the Forsaken, yes? Can you help free me? $B$BTime is short for me, I am afraid. Please hurry!',0),
(91862,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $C. Unfortunately we aren\'t out of danger yet.',0),
(91899,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for your hard work, Ana. There has been an uprising in bandits and thieves intercepting trade routes as of late. If you find other crates laying around, please bring them here and we\'ll handle the rest.$B$BHere is your payment.',0),
(91900,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for your hard work, $n. There has been an uprising in bandits and thieves intercepting trade routes as of late. If you find other crates laying around, please bring them here and we\'ll handle the rest.$B$BHere is your payment.',0),
(91904,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for your hard work, $n. There has been an uprising in bandits and thieves intercepting trade routes as of late. If you find other crates laying around, please bring them here and we\'ll handle the rest.$B$BHere is your payment.',0),
(91905,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for your hard work, Big. There has been an uprising in bandits and thieves intercepting trade routes as of late. If you find other crates laying around, please bring them here and we\'ll handle the rest.$B$BHere is your payment.',0),
(92109,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh my gosh! Look at these! Did you pick the herbs yourself?$B$BWow, thanks mister, I am going to see what I can make with these right now! Do you want to watch?',0),
(92110,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You brought me murloc eyes! I am so excited for my first REAL potion I can\'t breathe!$B$BI snuck out and grabbed a few more herbs while you were away and found some empty vials downstairs. Um... you can do the mixing this time.$B$B<The child watches enthusiastically you mix the ingredients, but her nose crumples as you add the eyes. The concoction takes on a sickly orange in mere seconds.>$B$BWow! See, I was right. I wouldn\'t drink that, but here\'s my recipe if you wanted to make more. Come back sometime!',0),
(92432,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I see Jacques was successful in garnering aid.$B$BWhile not strictly permitted, we cannot allow our pride to turn away allies in our desperate hour. Do not let the guards fool you. Things are anything but under control.',0),
(92434,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is surely no coincidence the horde has taken an interest in my city during such a precarious time.$B$BIn fact, I was counting on it. I have a proposition for you.',0),
(92459,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Where did you find this? The parlor?$B$B<Archmage Celindra\'s expression darkens momentarily before regaining her composure.>$B$BI think it is best you dispel this from your thoughts, friend. For now, the Kirin Tor welcomes a competent $C such as yourself. Welcome to Dalaran.',0),
(92481,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let me have a look at you. Yes, I believe you will make a fine young $C. The power of the arcane has waned amongst our people, but there are those who would seek to rediscover much of what we\'ve lost in the millennia we\'ve spent here amongst the clouds. I am sure that you will lead the charge in this never ending search for arcane knowledge, and ultimately make us proud.$B$BSpeak with me again if you wish to take your next steps.',0),
(92745,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, $n. But I fear the source of the poison may lie somewhere else...',0),
(92747,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What is all this?',0),
(92748,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Need something blown up?',0),
(92749,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is a great start! Now to tie it all together... and add a little extra zing...',0),
(92750,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hmm... Looking for something specific, are you?',0),
(92751,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great - that\'s the detonator we need!',0),
(92752,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'m glad you\'ve returned, $n.',0),
(92753,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So you found the forge, and planted the bomb... only one thing remains to be done.',0),
(93062,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There is a weight lifted off my shoulders knowing that you restored peace to so many bodies.$B$BAll my life I expected our clan wars to inevitably end in brutality and bloodshed. Never would I have guessed that I would be staring death in the face, with death staring right back.$B$BThank you, again, $n.',0),
(93128,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Khan Jehn has been slain!?$B$BI do not believe it. I cannot believe it. This was brazen! Foolish! Nerlokh had no authority to suggest such an attack!$B$BYet, if you are speaking the truth, I cannot deny that the defeat of Jehn bodes well for the future of our clan. A new Khan will soon take his place, but we have time to prepare our next move.$B$BI will speak with our Khan. For now, your work here is done. Bask in today\'s victory, but do not tempt fate further.',0),
(93797,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. I can indeed feel the elemental energies in this bough waiting to be harnessed by those that have the gift to do so. This will make an excellent spell focus.$B$BDid this branch sing to you, perhaps? It has often been the case that the branch picks the $C, and not the other way around.',0),
(93928,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'(PH) Thanks!',0),
(94473,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'May fire burn within your heart, $n.$B$BThe elements await you.',0),
(94493,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The Al\'aketh Cultists ambushed us with little to no warning. Many inside my den lay wounded or dying. I had attempted to send a message to Valanaar but it appears my efforts were in vain.$B$BPlease, if you have come here I beg for your help. I don\'t know how much longer my fellows will be able to survive this onslaught.',0),
(94616,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Take the water sapta and find the tainted pond water in Westfall, $n. I have great faith in your abilities.',0),
(94773,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have done the Light a great service by becoming a shining example to those who travel in these dangerous lands and beyond. Please, accept this lesson as a thanks for all you\'ve done.',0),
(94789,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Aye, I shall give ye what\'s needed to focus wind spells and to call upon the spirits o\' air. Take this totem, and when ye are ready, train with me some more.',0),
(94819,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Continue your service to the Light and you will become a great $C, $n. Maintain your vigilance and dedication!$B$BYou are ready for your next lesson in service.',0),
(94821,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You took your time arriving, $n. But you can be excused given your dedicated service to the Light. Please pay close attention to this lesson.',0),
(94822,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You took your time arriving, Cub. But you can be excused given your dedicated service to the Light. Please pay close attention to this lesson.',0),
(94824,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You took your time arriving, $n. But you can be excused given your dedicated service to the Light. Please pay close attention to this lesson.',0),
(94912,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Greetings, fellow $C. It pleases me to meet a fellow $C from among the Skyborne, and to be among the first to welcome you to Azeroth.$B$BI think you will find that my fellow druids of the Cenarion Circle have much wisdom to impart upon you, child of nature.',0),
(95034,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So now you understand. At the very end of his strength after being pierced by a dozen gnoll blades, he reared up to strike me. In that final moment we locked eyes, and I could tell he still knew who he was and that he recognized me. He knew what was happening but he had no control over himself. That was the worst part.$B$BIf such a thing is possible, I will see the creature that doomed him dead so that it can never visit this horror on another living thing. I swear it upon the sky above.',0),
(95041,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These cards seem a bit damp... but I can work with this! Thank you, $n!',0),
(95042,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ll no doubt notice the corruption that permeates this gem. For your purposes, The magic needed to dispel the evil that the naga witches have infused into the gem is rather simple. A shame really, there\'s much one could learn from such powers.$B$BI don\'t suppose you\'d be willing to abandon whatever quest caused you seek this gem, and sell it to me instead? It could prove valuable to my... academic pursuits.',0),
(95065,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Great timing! Caught a big one with my last bait. Great day so far. They\'re really biting out here!$B$BTell you what, since you were kind enough to keep this old man in business how about a few fish for the road?',0),
(95111,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Interesting. I don\'t think anyone has ever asked me to actually carry out a custom commission for them. Mostly I just make humble, functional weapons in my own style. It\'s not much, but its honest work and I don\'t seek accolades or glory.$B$BI\'m happy to try, but why would you seek me for this? There are plenty of smiths in the Undercity that will take on custom jobs like this.',0),
(95125,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This blade is my finest work and I hope it serves you well in your travels. Thank you again for this opportunity.$B$BAka\'Magosh, friend.',0),
(95126,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Trevan takes the blade and inspects it carefully.> $B$BThis will do nicely, Alteä. I knew that Ott had it in him to make something truly great.$B$BThe only thing left now is to kill that beast. Speak with Lumina when you are ready.',0),
(95140,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n. Banon may now rest in peace.$B$BIf you would be willing to allow it, I believe that I can impart some magic upon your freshly blooded blade to infuse it with a small measure of the magic of my people.$B$B<Lumina Windsinger\'s eyes begin to glow a vibrant blue as she touches the bloodstained blade in your hand.>$B$BIt is done. It\'s a small thing, and I could scarcely improve such a magnificent blade. Regardless, I will pray to the winds that it serves you well, $C.',0),
(95195,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your instincts to bring these to me were not unfounded. When Lordaeron fell to the scourge, many people fled to take refuge here in Stormwind. There are likely few who remain to claim these insignias themselves.$B$BYour duty to Stormwind is commended, $n. I\'ll begin distributing these tokens to next of kin right away.',0),
(95217,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re a resourceful one, $n.$B$BNow listen up - I\'m not going to repeat myself!',0),
(95328,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What an interesting specimen. From underneath the Whispering Forest, you say? It\'s no secret that foul place is touched by the void.$B$BI welcome the opportunity to explore the mysteries of shadow, $C. Allow me to offer you payment for what you\'ve found.',0),
(95508,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well, looks like we are all alive. I... knew that someday that would catch up to me. I\'m in your debt for your help here today.$B$BPlease, take this. It\'s not much, but its the least I can do.$B$BSafe travels, $C.',0),
(95621,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So they are looking for a deserter... Well, it seems that the past has finally caught up to me.',0),
(95646,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is worse than I feared. An ancient energy stirs. It would be most wise for you to carry word to your eager excavators to stop digging, for their own safety.',0),
(95697,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Look at the marbling on these! What are they eating up there? Thank you for going all the way and back for us. If you don\'t mind waiting, we\'ll cook some for you now, on the house, of course!',0),
(95737,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Llana must be wondering where those grass seeds are that I promised I\'d have my husband bring back! It comforts me to know she\'s as concerned as I am. It must be something about the excavation site itself that we\'re both sensing.',0),
(95803,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I don\'t doubt Danitha\'s sincerity and desire to earn a place for your kind amongst the Forsaken. However, I suspect that this isn\'t the last time we\'ll see one of your brothers and sisters go mad and turn the light against their own people.$B$BThere may come a time when I decide that tolerating your misbegotten order is no longer in the best interests of the Forsaken. I suggest you continue to serve your people diligently.$B$BWe will be watching.',0),
(95805,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<As you empty the incense into the fire, the scent wafts around you, leaving you with just the empty pouch and a subtle sense of fulfillment.>',0),
(95809,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Goodness, that sounds terrible!$B$BBy the light, I\'m grateful he\'s one of the survivors.$B$B<She holds the reed-woven heart to her own.>$B$BI\'ll start cooking a hearty meal for him. Thank you for bringing me this. I\'d like you to have something as a token of our appreciation.',0),
(95810,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, ye ventured all the way in and survived to tell the tale?! Let\'s have a look at what ye carry there. $B$BWell, knowing what ye went through to bring it back to me, I think it warrants a certain reverence for your artifact.',0),
(95883,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The tortured soul lets out a foul energy in the presence of the offering stone.$B$BIt appears you are closer to fulfilling the ritual.>',0),
(95884,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Strange implements and items litter the rough surface of the stone.$B$BThis is surely the offering stone that is mentioned in the note.>',0),
(95885,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The offering stone is inert now. It appears your ritual drained it of power. To what end, you do not know, but it is over now.$B$BThe rough stone cracks and crumbles, now devoid of purpose.$B$BSomething glitters from within the remnants...>',0),
(95999,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $n! Incinerator Gar\'im was preparing to bolster the defenses at Stonewatch Keep. With this victory, we may yet succeed in reclaiming the keep!',0),
(96130,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Taking the life of such a beautiful creature is a sad event, but it was necessary for the safety of our people. I will make certain that the pelt does not go to waste. Thank you.',0),
(96137,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ira? Are you sure? Sounds like the woman was damn near a ghost before she died. I\'m surprised you found her.$B$BRest assured I will take great care of this dagger.',0),
(96139,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This tome appears to be about the Valor family. I believe I\'ve heard of a few of them. Good folk. Not sure they merit an entire book about them.$B$BI\'ll make you a copy of the tome. If you see anything else related to them on your travels, I\'ll be happy to take it off your hands.',0),
(96204,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you again, $n. I\'ve been aquatinting myself with Trevan here, who I\'ve learned sent you along on my trail.$B$BI\'ve heard... less than charitable things about paladins thus far in my travels. As a sky-touched shen\'dorei elf traveling through horde territory, I can certainly understand how easily intolerance and prejudice can take root. $B$BYou and your kind have a friend among the Windshapers.',0),
(96243,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The land itself let me know ye were comin\'! Aye, sometimes, the burnin\' fire within us is enough to power us through the snow without even touchin\' the ground!',0),
(96259,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for your service to the people of this land. It may take time for us to completely clear out the infestation, but your efforts have created a stable foothold for us to leverage against these vile creatures.',0),
(96264,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Interestin\'. The quilboar plan tae flood the Thousand Needles, eh? Those good fer nothin\' beasts never did respect the elements. With abuse of this magnitude, it\'s no wonder we can feel it from here.$B$BYe did good findin\' the source of this threat, $n, but now we gotta put an end to it.',0),
(96294,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is... most disturbing. Why would a druid be behind a brood of dangerous spiders? Who or what is this \"Wild King\" and \"Pact\" that is referenced in this letter?$B$BI will confer with the druids of the Cenarion Circle on this. Perhaps they will know more.$B$BThank you again for your aid. As disturbing as this information is, we will rest easier knowing that the person controlling these vile creatures has been destroyed.',0),
(96606,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'So now that we\'ve learned the basics, why don\'t you go and learn a tradeskill from the trainers in the village nearby. They will also teach you how to create a camp fixture suitable to your new profession.',0),
(96630,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Is that my journal? I\'ve been missing this for a while. Thank you, $C.$B$BHey, you\'ve got the look of an adventurer yourself. How would you like to learn about camping?',0),
(96634,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With this, you\'ll be able to set up a camp anywhere out in the wilderness. What you\'ve learned is just the basics, so you won\'t be able to place too many furnishings around it.$B$BRaise your cooking skill and you might just be able to learn to make even bigger fires.$B$BYou can also learn the basics of furnishing your campsites from other tradeskill trainers if you\'re savvy in their skills.',0),
(96652,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Is that my journal? I\'ve been missing this for a while. Thank you, $C.$B$BHey, you\'ve got the look of an adventurer yourself. How would you like to learn about camping?',0),
(96655,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With this, you\'ll be able to set up a camp anywhere out in the wilderness. What you\'ve learned is just the basics, so you won\'t be able to place too many furnishings around it.$B$BRaise your cooking skill and you might just be able to learn to make even bigger fires.$B$BYou can also learn the basics of furnishing your campsites from other tradeskill trainers if you\'re savvy in their skills.',0),
(96661,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With this, you\'ll be able to set up a camp anywhere out in the wilderness. What you\'ve learned is just the basics, so you won\'t be able to place too many furnishings around it.$B$BRaise your cooking skill and you might just be able to learn to make even bigger fires.$B$BYou can also learn the basics of furnishing your campsites from other tradeskill trainers if you\'re savvy in their skills.',0),
(96779,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'With Tomas dead, Durnholde Keep will no doubt be destabilized. Lowly thugs of the Syndicate\'s kind often fall to disarray without a figurehead to lead them.$B$BGood work, $n. I may call upon you for future missions.',0),
(96875,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your work helps Orgrimmar grow. Know that as you walk the city\'s paths.',0),
(96877,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What a trophy, $C! That must have been some fight!',0),
(96896,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I plan to stay here for a time and speak with more of my friends, but I will return to Light\'s Hope Chapel in Eastern Plaguelands soon enough. Should you ever find yourself out that way, please do say hello. We could use always use more help from able-bodied adventurers.',0),
(97005,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My dead men will rest easier knowing that there is one less of these monsters in the world. You\'ve done well, and are a true and stalwart defender of the alliance. Thank you.$B$BGo with honor, $n.',0),
(97220,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, dear. You think we want to carry that up the stairs ourselves? Keeping the valuables intact is your responsibility up until the point you drop it off.',0),
(97222,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yep. There\'s a reason that hinge opens inwards towards them, so they don\'t get the door blocked by people leaving stuff anywhere they please.$B$BConsider us professionally acquainted, $C. $B$BWe respect your business, and expect you to respect ours.',0),
(97234,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Let\'s see here. Roy\'s Book Club, isn\'t it? I recognize this wrap technique. $B$BWell, if he says this is what people want to talk about, it\'s all fine by me. The material we receive back is always in as good of quality as we loaned it, so we know they\'re treating it with respect regardless of how provoking the words may be.',0),
(97236,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'My, my. How I do love surprises, $n.$B$BThis specimen will surely help further my studies.',0),
(97237,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are them! Some of them even smell exotic! Fantastic, I can\'t wait for us to have lively conversations about these writings.$B$BCellar after hours, of course.$B$BThanks for the quick errand run, $n. As promised, it\'s on the house. We keep our word here.',0),
(97263,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What! I\'ve been going to the mailbox by the bank every day looking for this package! This city needs to figure out its layout. Not easy to navigate like Aerie Peak!$B$BLet\'s see what I\'ve got... totem carving tools... spare axe... some kind of goblin device? I didn\'t order that! Ah, I\'ll just send it back.$B$BEr, uh... I mean... thank you for bringing all of this to me. Here\'s a little something for your trouble.',0),
(97275,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Grorru--whaa?$B$BYou say Yelmak made this potion from speargrass and cattail with no other reagents? I didn\'t know chemists had any real need for these common plants we see every day.$B$BMaybe he\'s right. There could be a lot I\'m missing out on by skipping to the most rare and least-studied flora first.$B$BDrakath, take your pick from one of these potions I brewed earlier. I appreciate you taking the time to visit our shop.',0),
(97286,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Your actions show you are one who respects knowledge. The library is open for use in your studies.',0),
(97538,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, thank you, $n.$B$BIt means much to me to have you venture all the way out there for what must seem a trivial notion from an old tauren, but with your kindness I will have enough pigment for the rest of the season.$B$BThank you for supporting my livelihood, and I will strive to create something magnificent with the pigments you have brought.',0),
(97583,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<The slime shudders with newfound energy. It seems to want to follow you, now that it has associated you with food.>',0),
(97894,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Old Borgy sent you? Always looking out for me.$B$BWe could certainly use another set of hands around here. Business has all but stopped with the recent tragedy, and I think you could help set things right.',0),
(97899,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There ya have it, directions for your very own Mana Well. Most folks don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to try it out.$B$BNo camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those as the basis of your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. Check in with someone who can train you in cooking if you haven\'t already learned the basics.',0),
(97900,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Sharpening Wheel. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.',0),
(97901,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There you have it, you can craft your very own Enchanted Lute. Most folks don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to try it out.$B$BNo camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those as the basis of your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. Check in with someone who can train you in cooking if you haven\'t already learned the basics.',0),
(97902,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Reagent Bot. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.',0),
(97903,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There you have it, you can now craft your very own First Aid Kit. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.',0),
(97904,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dere ya have it, ya be craftin\' your very own Fish Bowl. Most folk don\'t be carin\' much for camps being set up in da center of town, so ya be needin\' ta head into da wilderness if ya be wantin\' to try it out.$B$BNo camp is complete without a campfire, mon. Ya be needin\' one of dose before ya be startin\' up your camp. Most cooks be teachin\' ya ta make a fire. Check in with someone who can train ya in da culinary arts if ya haven\'t already learned da basics.',0),
(97905,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Dere ya have it, ya be craftin\' your very own Incense Candle. Most folk don\'t be carin\' much for camps being set up in da center of town, so ya be needin\' ta head into da wilderness if ya be wantin\' to try it out.$B$BNo camp is complete without a campfire, mon. Ya be needin\' one of dose before ya be startin\' up your camp. Most cooks be teachin\' ya ta make a fire. Check in with someone who can train ya in da culinary arts if ya haven\'t already learned da basics.',0),
(97906,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There you have it, your very own camp tent. Most folk don\'t care much for tents being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.',0),
(97907,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Lodestone. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.',0),
(97908,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Camp Chair. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.',0),
(97914,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Baros opens the letter and begins to read it, his smile fading.>',0),
(97926,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Sad news indeed. Still, I thank you for making the journey.$B$BWith neither Stormwind nor Darnassus coming to aid us, it seems that Auberdine\'s fate is our own to decide.',0),
(97927,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Mana Well. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.',0),
(97928,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Sharpening Wheel. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.',0),
(97929,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Enchanted Lute. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.',0),
