(97946,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There you have it, your very own camp tent. Most folk don\'t care much for tents being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.',0),
(97948,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Lodestone. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.',0),
(97949,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Camp Chair. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.',0),
(97977,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, it\'s even worse than I thought.$B$BThese engravings tell us that the Gnarlpine began having nightmares of being wiped out by some great shadow. Before long, that fear turned to rage--and the shadow to their former elven friends. To be aware of your own mind slipping away from you...$B$BOur only hope is that this may help us better understand what is happening on Teldrassil. Thank you for your aid, $n.',0),
(97979,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You have seen what our goddess provides. Use it well, and she will never forsake you.',0),
(98013,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Do not fret, young one. To pillage one\'s own home for some dark master...$B$BIt is unforgivable.',0),
(98025,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It is good to know that issue has been taken care of, but it saddens me that we could not find another way. Jai\'vhanel had been somewhat of a guardian of this area for quite some time, and I am not sure what could have caused her decent into madness.$B$BRegardless, thank you for your service today, $C. The roads to Auberdine are safe for travel once again.',0),
(98028,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Onu appears surprised--or as surprised as an ancient can appear.>$B$BStairs descending down in Mathystra? Could be it be?$B$B<Onu shakes his head.>$B$BI must confer with the others on this. For now, know that it is good you uncovered this before the naga... or their cult allies.$B$BPlease accept this as thanks for your efforts. It is no small feat to defeat an elemental guardian.',0),
(98042,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Thundris does not speak for some time.>$B$BThis bears the mark of an ancient evil, $C. I will see it brought to Darnassus at once for further study.$B$BAnde\'thoras-ethil.',0),
(98067,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I thank you for your aid. Though I find peace in the daily rituals, it is nice to have a moment to reflect instead.',0),
(98070,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is wonderful news! I will send word to our suppliers that the harpies have been dealt with. At least that is one less threat the future caravans will need to worry about.',0);
INSERT INTO `quest_offer_reward` (`ID`,`Emote1`,`Emote2`,`Emote3`,`Emote4`,`EmoteDelay1`,`EmoteDelay2`,`EmoteDelay3`,`EmoteDelay4`,`RewardText`,`VerifiedBuild`) VALUES
(98072,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'re a real natural talent! Say, if you ever decide to take a break from the adventuring life, you come on back to your buddy James. I\'ll put you right to work!$B$BAlthough, I suppose you\'ll be even older by then. Oh well!',0),
(98093,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for helping me out, $n. I\'ll let Camp Taurajo know you were able to rescue me. I\'m so lucky you helped, I could have been stuck there all day!$B$BThis is all I have to spare, but I hope it\'s useful to you.$B$BI\'ll be making my exit once I make the careful climb down.',0),
(98155,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you, $n! These hides are in perfect condition. I can\'t imagine it was easy to get so many, but I am very grateful to you for your work.',0),
(98156,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This is from our sister? We hadn\'t heard from her in some time. I hope she is doing well.$B$BMy, these pelts have such a beautiful color of fur! Kelly and I will make sure we put these to good use.$B$BThank you for making the long journey. It is good to know Kristy is still doing well and is thinking of us.',0),
(98197,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah! A bit damp, but nothing a few days in the sun won\'t fix.$B$BThank you, $C. It\'s nice to not solely rely on shipments from Theramore or Auberdine for once!',0),
(98216,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Look there--see how the Goaz Stone starts to glow when near the keystone? I can almost make out some more words...$B$BWe still must learn more about this Goaz. I feel like we\'re just on the tip of the iceberg with something huge!',0),
(98219,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, of course. Another one of Stormwind\'s finest here to check on me. Same as last month!',0),
(98221,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ironforge as well? Nek\'rosh certainly has his father\'s ambition!$B$BWhat he lacks, of course, is the enslaved army of red drakes that proved so devastating in the war. He\'s made a gambit, alright--one he will pay for dearly.',0),
(98230,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'If yer here to help, I won\'t say no. Help\'s awful hard to come by these days.',0),
(98282,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Oh, perfect! This is exactly what I need. You\'re a real hero, you know.$B$BPlease, I\'d be remiss if I didn\'t share some of the fruits of your labors with you. Stay safe out there!',0),
(98285,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Reagent Bot. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.',0),
(98286,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'There you have it, you can now craft your very own Enchanted Lute. Most folk don\'t care much for camps being set up in the center of town, so you\'ll need to head into the wilderness if you want to test it out.$B$BOh, and just remember, no camp is complete without a campfire. You\'ll need one of those before you start up your camp. Most cooks can teach you to make a fire. If you haven\'t already, you might want to check in with someone who can train you in the culinary arts to learn the basics.',0),
(98291,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You won\'t catch me mournin\' their ilk. They deserve their fate.',0),
(98297,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I can\'t thank ye enough, $n. Truly, I cannae do enough for what ye\'ve done today.$B$BMuch remains to be done before Grim Batol might hear the laughter of wee dwarven children echo through its halls again, but it\'s a mighty good step closer.$B$BFor all of the dwarves lost in those dark days, we may yet reclaim what was ours.$B$BHere\'s hopin\', anyway.',0),
(98299,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'It seems the Gilneans are not too keen on allowing anyone past their wall. That is fortunate, I suppose. It means there is likely no chance for the worgen curse to spread to their city.$B$BCan you imagine the depravity if an entire kingdom were infected?',0),
(98300,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, the Wildhammer. Yes, I know them well. They may not call me sovereign, but our relations have improved greatly as of late--the Thandol Span is a testament to that.$B$BIf what this Howin reports is true, then we must prepare for further action on our northern borders. Grim Batol has a deep, bloody history, and I\'m well aware of its strategic significance.$B$BFor your efforts in helping the Wildhammer in the Wetlands, and the Alliance in Menethil Harbor as well, you have my thanks.',0),
(98326,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Yer a real lifesaver, $n!$B$BMy husband would just laugh it off, but I couldn\'t bare tellin\' him he has to spend another night on the lake. Maybe now we can enjoy a real feast.',0),
(98372,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The deceased Night Watchman lying before you is covered in deep gashes and cuts. It\'s clear to see that he was mauled by some sort of large beast.$B$BYou notice that the corpse has an unlit torch in his hand. You reach down and pry it from his stiff fingers. This could be useful in your travels through Duskwood and beyond to reveal things hidden by darkness.',0),
(98387,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Excellent work, $n. With the Blackrock orcs cut off from their allies in the Burning Steppes, they will have no hope of maintaining their foothold here without proper supplies.',0),
(98398,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'As you inspect the fallen bark, a voice enters your mind. It is calm and soothing, cresting over you like a gentle breeze through the leaves.',0),
(98403,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I should have known this was being used to twist the spiders of this land.$B$BI have heard whispers of this substance being the source of much of the corruption plaguing us. Though this is not the original, it is an older sample and may yield more information than what we have obtained so far.$B$BNormally I would have you send this to Darnassus for further study. However, it is best we kept this quiet for the moment, or Dolanaar will never recover its reputation.$B$BI trust you to do the same.',0),
(98430,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I am relieved that Longwalker Stormhoof is well. He is my most trusted scout, and his mission of the utmost importance.$B$BPlease, accept my thanks and my hospitality for riskng your life to save his own. You have done a greater service to our people than you know.$B$BI encourage you to explore our great city while you are here. It is a place of safety, and you will find many that may aid you on your own travels upon its bluffs.$B$BIsh-ne-alo por-ah.',0),
(98459,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Bart unwraps the gift.>$B$BWhy that no good, son of a--$B$BDid he even tell you that HE is the one who cheats at poker?! I only won enough money to buy the Maiden\'s Virtue after we kicked him out of our poker circle!$B$BI swear, the next time I see that absolute waste of seawater--$B$BI\'m sorry, I\'m sorry. I shouldn\'t shoot the messenger. On behalf of the crew of the Maiden\'s Virtue--finest ship in the Great Sea--welcome to Menethil Harbor!',0),
(98461,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Tarrel reads the note.>$B$BOh... oh my. Poor Hollee.$B$BShe always did have a bit of a thing for me. And, truth be told, there was a time where I would have reciprocated. But I\'m married. Happily married!$B$BI think the best thing to do here is not to reply. I don\'t know how to let her down, and I have far more pressing things to worry about here! My wife is missing!',0),
(98463,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'I\'ve got what you need, pal! Stay awhile, spend some of that gold weighing down your pocket, and have a good time.$B$BWelcome to the Salty Sailor Tavern!',0),
(98545,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thanks for delivering this, pal.$B$BWait... he said I\'d tip you? I didn\'t agree to that! $B$BFine. Take your pick of this junk in the lost and found. You\'d be surprised how many of these Forsaken leave their stuff laying around after getting haircuts. There\'s a joke here about them being brainless, but I suspect in a lot of cases it might actually be true.',0),
(98815,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'These are some of the most impressive hides I\'ve ever held; these will make spectacular detailing on all of my fine trim. Thank you, $n. $B$BTry these on and take one you\'d like in trade.',0),
(98824,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'What\'s this you\'ve got...$B$BWoah! Look at this marvel! The light through it dances like nothin\' I\'ve seen since my first dig in old Uldaman. The marks of the keepers on this cannot be mistaken.$B$BYou\'ve done the League a great service bringin\' this home. A find like this pushes the very boundaries o\' the world\'s wisdom forward.$B$BWe\'ll be sure to record the details of your contribution! Truly a job well done, adventurer.',0),
(98887,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The sands of the Darkspear Islands are awash with the blood of the Alliance you\'ve killed. Well done, $n.$B$BFor the Horde!',0),
(98895,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You\'ve distinguished yourself honorably in battle at the Darkspear Islands and your efforts have not gone unnoticed.$B$BThere are ever more battles to fight, however. Continue to prove yourself in battle and you will surely reap the rewards.',0),
(98906,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You be showin\' strength and dedication out at the Darkspear Islands! Your prowess in battle are to be admired, mon!',0),
(99046,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Elune\'s grace... I shall not die... alone...',0),
(99047,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'The harpies have become afflicted by the same foulness showing up throughout the forest. I\'m sure that is what ails Sentinel Eralya as well.$B$BWe must hurry. It won\'t be long before she succumbs to her injuries.',0),
(99049,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'This banner and blade piece belong to the naga! They must have come down the coast from the north.$B$BWe cannot let them establish a foothold here. The pressure from both directions would be too much for Razor Hill.',0),
(99050,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank you for your help. Please, accept this to help with the costs of the vial and water.$B$BNow, to make the salve. It should only take a moment.',0),
(99051,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Hopefully that sends them packing back to the north. I\'ll have some grunts keep an eye out for any stragglers or funny business.',0),
(99053,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Thank Elune you were around to help Lynessa avoid a dark fate with the Gnarlpine. She\'s one of our best, and a personal friend.$B$BPlease, take this in thanks. May it serve you well in keeping the kaldorei safe.',0),
(99073,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'<Eralya\'s breath calms quickly as you help her ingest the salve. She may not survive, but is at relative peace.>',0),
(99108,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'You honor me with your abilities, $C. Perhaps the new generation has hope yet.$B$BTake these to tend to your wounds, for many more battles await you in this harsh world.',0),
(99123,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Ah, Pal\'juh got herself in trouble again, did she?$B$BHopefully she learns her lesson about going alone this time. Thank you for helping her. She\'s a promising hunter, just tends to act more like a raptor than a tiger.',0),
(99152,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done, recruit. We might just make something out of you yet.$B$BWith these bones we may be able to better understand how such a threat was able to go unnoticed for so long.',0),
(99153,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Well done--and quick, too! Now onto my favorite part...',0),
(99411,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,0,'Fantastic work, $n! Kyle came home as soon as he ate and went straight to bed. Thank you for your help.',0);
