(79095,0,0,0,0,'Have you brought something to add to our collection?',0),
(79360,0,0,0,0,'Danger? There\'s been no reports of anything like that. And our wind riders are far too busy to spend their time chasing ghost stories.',0),
(79362,0,0,0,0,'You\' legs be lookin\' a wobbly der. De ground be shakin?',0),
(79363,0,0,0,0,'Wade into any danger yet?',0),
(79364,0,0,0,0,'We need a larger vial and one of crystal clarity to contain these elements.',0),
