(84401,0,0,0,0,'Have you brought something to add to our collection?',0),
(84402,0,0,0,0,'Have you brought something to add to our collection?',0),
(86613,0,0,0,0,'We just, uh, need to adjust our dig site and we can get this whole thing back on track!',0),
(86614,0,0,0,0,'I have a lot of chores today, so can you keep it quick?',0),
(86667,0,0,0,0,'Eh? What do you want?',0),
(86758,0,0,0,0,'How goes the huntin\'?',0),
(87288,0,0,0,0,'It is good to see you again! Are you here to trade?',0),
(87760,0,0,0,0,'We will finally have resolution to this mystery, and the animals will have peace at last!',0),
(88758,0,0,0,0,'Have you found any sign of her?',0),
(91732,0,0,0,0,'Have you been to the mine yet?',0),
(91736,0,0,0,0,'A strong scent of apples burns your nose as you inspect the device.',0),
(91738,0,0,0,0,'The sergeant\'s eyes light up as he notices your bottle of Thunder Applejack...',0),
(91740,0,0,0,0,'Yes?',0),
(91746,0,0,0,0,'Yes?',0),
(91751,0,0,0,0,'Any luck with those wolf pelts?',0),
(91862,0,0,0,0,'Gnolls are the second worst creatures I\'ve encountered yet on Azeroth.',0),
(91899,0,0,0,0,'Another delivery! Fantastic. Set it over by the pile and we can discuss your compensation.',0),
(91900,0,0,0,0,'Another delivery! Fantastic. Set it over by the pile and we can discuss your compensation.',0),
(91904,0,0,0,0,'Another delivery! Fantastic. Set it over by the pile and we can discuss your compensation.',0),
(91905,0,0,0,0,'Another delivery! Fantastic. Set it over by the pile and we can discuss your compensation.',0),
(92109,0,0,0,0,'\'Ello again! Did you bring back alchemy stuff?',0),
(92110,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t worry about me, I\'m a big girl. I can take care of myself. Just don\'t tell anyone I am hiding here, it\'s our little secret.',0),
(92434,0,0,0,0,'Stay your weapon, $R.$B$BI think you will find that key won\'t be enough to get past my wards. You didn\'t truly think we would leave such a vulnerability open at a time like this, did you?',0),
(92459,0,0,0,0,'Archmage Modera speaks highly of you. What brings you to Dalaran?',0),
(92481,0,0,0,0,'Greetings, $n. I\'m pleased to have the privilege of furthering your magical studies.',0),
(92747,0,0,0,0,'Did you find anything?',0),
(92749,0,0,0,0,'Show me those explosives, $n!',0),
(93797,0,0,0,0,'Every year that passes in Zephras sees fewer and fewer of those who are gifted with a talent for magic. $B$BI am glad to see young mages such as yourself participate in our oldest traditions to help keep our history and culture alive and well.',0),
(95041,0,0,0,0,'How is the data retrieval progressing?',0),
(95042,0,0,0,0,'Kor gems can be used for great acts of evil. Far be it from me to judge if your intentions are pure. It matters not to me.',0),
(95065,0,0,0,0,'Did you get the fishing supplies?',0),
(95111,0,0,0,0,'Are you in need of a blade, $C?',0),
(95126,0,0,0,0,'Was Ott able to carry out the commission?',0),
(95140,0,0,0,0,'Is it done? Is the beast slain?',0),
(95195,0,0,0,0,'You look as if you\'re carrying a heavy burden, $n. What is it?',0),
(95217,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t slack off, $n. Smithin\' isn\'t for the lazy!',0),
(95328,0,0,0,0,'Do you have something for me, $C?',0),
(95621,0,0,0,0,'The remnants of Daelin Proudmoore\'s fleet who still fly his banner are just as rotten and barbaric as the admiral himself was before he died.$B$BI don\'t know why they are so far from Tiragarde, but it can\'t be good.',0),
(95646,0,0,0,0,'These waters harbor unique life in a brine that gives and takes equally.',0),
(95697,0,0,0,0,'Farm-raised boar, farm-raised crawler... what\'s next, farm-raised raptor?',0),
(95803,0,0,0,0,'Why are you addressing me, $C?',0),
(95805,0,0,0,0,'<The smoke from the incense rises toward the sky.>',0),
(95809,0,0,0,0,'I\'m more than worried about him!',0),
(95810,0,0,0,0,'Here for the dig?',0),
(95883,0,0,0,0,'<The offering stone is ominously still.>',0),
(95885,0,0,0,0,'<The offering stone is ominously still.>',0),
(95999,0,0,0,0,'What do you have there, $R?',0),
(96130,0,0,0,0,'Have you found the big wolf?',0),
(96137,0,0,0,0,'What have you got there?',0),
(96139,0,0,0,0,'Have you found anything? I\'m not holding out much hope.',0),
(96264,0,0,0,0,'Back so soon? What\'d ye find?',0),
(96294,0,0,0,0,'What is this?',0),
(96606,0,0,0,0,'Having the skills needed to survive the outdoors are critical. A well-rested and well-prepared adventurer has a much higher chance of surviving this lifestyle.',0),
(96630,0,0,0,0,'Are you here to learn about camping in the wilderness?',0),
(96634,0,0,0,0,'A good campfire is the foundation to any good camp.',0),
(96652,0,0,0,0,'Are you here to learn about camping in the wilderness?',0),
(96655,0,0,0,0,'A good campfire is the foundation to any good camp.',0),
(96661,0,0,0,0,'A good campfire is the foundation to any good camp.',0),
(96875,0,0,0,0,'Yes?',0),
(96877,0,0,0,0,'Yes?',0),
(97220,0,0,0,0,'You looking to fill a crate with our finest aged wheels?',0),
(97234,0,0,0,0,'Please keep your voice down.',0),
(97237,0,0,0,0,'You forgot what you had to do the moment you stepped through the door, eh? Happens to everyone.',0),
(97263,0,0,0,0,'What\'s that you\'ve got there?',0),
(97275,0,0,0,0,'Alright, what\'s next... Black Lotus, Mountain Silversage...',0),
(97538,0,0,0,0,'You have returned! Were you able to find the mirkweed plant pods in Mirkfallon Lake?$B$BWe tauren have used this plant pigment in our paints for generations, so any amount you manage to bring would be appreciated. Though there are many ways to get a red pigment, I find the mirkweed to give the richest and most vibrant hue of the methods I\'m familiar with.',0),
(97583,0,0,0,0,'<The slime seems to regard you with interest.>',0),
(97903,0,0,0,0,'I can teach you once you\'ve gained some skill with your profession.',0),
(97904,0,0,0,0,'I can teach you once you\'ve gained some skill as a fisherman.',0),
(97914,0,0,0,0,'I can smell the sea on you, friend!$B$B<Baros laughs.>$B$BWhat brings you to Stormwind?',0),
(97926,0,0,0,0,'You have returned. What news comes from Stormwind?',0),
(97940,0,0,0,0,'Yes, I can teach you.',0),
(97977,0,0,0,0,'Don\'t worry about any larger totems you might find. I wouldn\'t know what to do with them if you found a way to get them!',0),
(98025,0,0,0,0,'Greetings $C - what may the Sentinels assist you with today? Perhaps you are here to inquire about the bounty on Jai\'vhanel?',0),
(98028,0,0,0,0,'I can sense something far older than you in my presence, $R... what have you brought me?',0),
(98042,0,0,0,0,'You look troubled. I am listening.',0),
(98072,0,0,0,0,'Ah, $n! Do you have those scales?',0),
(98155,0,0,0,0,'Were you able to collect the pelts? Rendow has promised to help me clean and tan them to send back home! I know my sisters will be very excited.',0),
(98197,0,0,0,0,'Keep your wits about you beneath the waves. There\'s plenty of nasties down there!',0),
(98216,0,0,0,0,'Did the stone do anything?!',0),
(98221,0,0,0,0,'Wars are won--and lost--on information. You would do well to remember that.',0),
(98282,0,0,0,0,'Have you had any luck? I know it\'s a pain to ask, but I really do need a whole gland!',0),
(98300,0,0,0,0,'Welcome to Ironforge, $C. I am King Magni Bronzebeard, ruler of these lands.',0),
(98326,0,0,0,0,'It\'ll be a hot day in Dun Morogh before I tell Paxton I lost his entire stockpile to a wendigo.',0),
(98387,0,0,0,0,'Most of what you find will have been raided from Lakeshire anyway. It will do me good to know our people will thrive while the orcs wither.',0),
(98403,0,0,0,0,'<Tallonkai lowers his voice.>$B$BDoes Xethorr still walk freely?',0),
(98459,0,0,0,0,'Put yer backs into it! We set sail on my word!$B$BOh? What\'s that you have there, traveler?',0),
(98461,0,0,0,0,'What\'s all this about?',0),
(98545,0,0,0,0,'What\'s that? You say that Leonid sent you? Oh boy, haven\'t seen that crusty old soldier since Naxxramas was raining hell down on our heads.',0),
(98815,0,0,0,0,'Welcome back, $C. Need any leather oil for your equipment?',0),
(98824,0,0,0,0,'Have a look at our gallery, but please, don\'t touch the artifacts, unless it\'s one you\'re here to donate to the library.',0),
(98887,0,0,0,0,'What news from the Darkspear Islands, $n?',0),
(98895,0,0,0,0,'How goes your campaign in the Darkspear Islands, $n?',0),
(99049,0,0,0,0,'Did you find her?',0),
(99050,0,0,0,0,'Do you have the ingredients? I fear Eralya may not have long.',0),
(99051,0,0,0,0,'Hopefully those snake scum aren\'t giving you trouble?',0),
(99073,0,0,0,0,'<Eralya has stopped responding verbally. Only a weak, gurgled exhale confirms life.>',0),
(99152,0,0,0,0,'You\'d best not be returning empty-handed. I either need the bones I asked for, or your body on a stretcher to confirm you at least gave it your all trying to get them.',0),
(99153,0,0,0,0,'Did you find the damned thing?',0),
(99411,0,0,0,0,'Did you find Kyle?',0);
